WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.144
Hold the other end
[A plucked string opens. A bowed string answers.]

2
00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:11.368
I tried a childhood in eight words.

3
00:00:11.368 --> 00:00:17.463
My mother took two corners of the sheet.

4
00:00:17.463 --> 00:00:24.629
I could put a pale stripe on her wrist where her watch had been.

5
00:00:24.629 --> 00:00:31.345
It was the ease of the wrist that made me stop.

6
00:00:31.345 --> 00:00:37.345
[The two strings sound the same D for six beats.]

7
00:00:37.345 --> 00:00:42.178
I kept the sheet.

8
00:00:42.178 --> 00:00:50.305
Between the lift and the fold there’s a little while when the air has a roof.

9
00:00:50.305 --> 00:00:56.393
I set a D in the crease for four beats.

10
00:00:56.393 --> 00:01:03.224
When I put the parts face to face, four seemed stingy.

11
00:01:03.224 --> 00:01:10.865
I gave it six.
